  m_text: Throughout the map, players can find numerous photographs of different
    Rituals left behind by previous, unsuccessful visitors. Each photograph represents
    a Ritual that once had an effect on the ghost. \nThe Ritual with the highest
    number of photographs is most likely the third and final required Ritual.
